#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/3-robot_usds.md:7
#: b67662659c2143d897bd22dc793fb30a
msgid ""
"Brand labels in this docs set follow [README_zh-CN.md "
"§3.1](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot_usds/blob/main/README_zh-"
"CN.md#31-中文简称与英文标识对照). English folder names match that table. Examples: "
"方舟无限 = **ARX**; 高擎 = **HighTorque** / Panthera; 越疆 = **Dobot**; 银河通用 = "
"**Galbot**; 第五纪 = **FiveAges**."
msgstr ""
"本文档的品牌中英文对照遵循 [README_zh-CN.md §3.1](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_usds/blob/main/README_zh-"
"CN.md#31-中文简称与英文标识对照)。英文目录名与该表一致。例如：方舟无限 = **ARX**；高擎 = **HighTorque** / "
"Panthera；越疆 = **Dobot**；银河通用 = **Galbot**；第五纪 = **FiveAges**。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/3-robot_usds.md:9
#: 36e91290fd464c5a966df5dc5dff25d0
msgid ""
"The [upstream README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_usds/blob/main/README.md) is the gallery and the full model "
"list. This page records how the tree is checked out and which paths are "
"git submodules."
msgstr "[上游 README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot_usds/blob/main/README.md) 是图册和完整机型列表。本页记录这棵树怎么检出，以及哪些路径是 git 子模块。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/3-robot_usds.md:11
#: 5c06eee1d2694d5bb131a469c116670b
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "用途"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/3-robot_usds.md:13
#: f7399d88aece45fea2a4d3e05c49f5ed
msgid ""
"`robot_usds` holds the robot USD models used in Isaac Sim, including in-"
"tree brand folders and a small set of git submodules. Environment and "
"project scenes are not in this repository; they sit beside it under FaSim"
" `environment/`. See [Environment assets](5-env_assets.md)."
msgstr "`robot_usds` 存放 Isaac Sim 用的机器人 USD，包括仓库内的品牌目录和少量 git 子模块。环境和项目场景不在这个仓库里，它们放在 FaSim 的 `environment/` 下，与它同级。见 [环境资产](5-env_assets.md)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/3-robot_usds.md:15
#: 9e20923fda8147b38279bf93da9d24ed
msgid "Checkout"
msgstr "检出"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/3-robot_usds.md:17
#: 91cc169d89b9441582f5469cfdf7dcf3
msgid ""
"**Primary path:** inside FaSim-Isaac, `./init.sh` operation 1 initializes"
" `robots/` according to `submodules_visibility.conf`. Start Sim with "
"`./run.sh`. There is no `./run.sh --robot`; open the USD from `robots/` "
"or from a scene under `environment/`. Steps: [Isaac "
"Sim](../../2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md)."
msgstr "**主路径：** 在 FaSim-Isaac 里，`./init.sh` 操作 1 按 `submodules_visibility.conf` 初始化 `robots/`。用 `./run.sh` 启动 Sim。没有 `./run.sh --robot`；从 `robots/` 或 `environment/` 下的场景打开 USD。步骤见 [Isaac Sim](../../2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md)。"

