#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/3-robot_usds.md:34
#: d40e18fb269f4601a2c2e329c2aeecf3
msgid ""
"Standalone clone only if you are not using FaSim. After a plain clone, "
"submodule directories are empty until you init them at the paths in "
"`.gitmodules`:"
msgstr "只有不走 FaSim 时才单独克隆。普通 clone 之后，子模块目录是空的，要按 `.gitmodules` 里的路径做 init："

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/3-robot_usds.md:36
#: 4df6f3131b6742b8b7bca0a859d82a56
msgid ""
"git clone https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot_usds.git\n"
"cd robot_usds\n"
"git submodule update --init"
msgstr ""
"git clone https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot_usds.git\n"
"cd robot_usds\n"
"git submodule update --init"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/3-robot_usds.md:42
#: 5f348c6c859544a8880e3bc07a9a96e0
msgid ""
"To init one public gitlink, for example Gen2: `git submodule update "
"--init humanoid/FiveAges/Gen2`. If you use robot_usds outside FaSim, put "
"`environment/fiveages_env` next to this tree so scene USDs can reference "
"it ([environment README note](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_usds/blob/main/README.md))."
msgstr "只初始化某一个公开 gitlink 时，以 Gen2 为例：`git submodule update --init humanoid/FiveAges/Gen2`。如果在 FaSim 之外使用 robot_usds，把 `environment/fiveages_env` 放在这棵树旁边，场景 USD 才能引用它（[环境 README 说明](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot_usds/blob/main/README.md)）。"

